  "notes": "{演技|えんぎ} refers to the skill or act of performing a role. It covers both genuine theatrical acting and pretending/faking in everyday life.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {演技|えんぎ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {演技|えんぎ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to act, to perform\n- {演技|えんぎ}{力|りょく}: acting ability/skill\n- {演技|えんぎ}{派|は}: method actor\n- {演技|えんぎ}⟦{賞|しょう}→賞：03227_shou⟧: acting award, best actor/actress prize\n- {演技|えんぎ}⟦{指導|しどう}→指導：03190_shidou⟧: acting coaching\n\nFUNCTIONS:\n1. Theatrical/film acting: ⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{演技|えんぎ}⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{素晴|すば}らしい→素晴らしい：01119_subarashii⟧ (his acting is wonderful)\n2. Pretending/faking: ⟦{病気|びょうき}→病気：00771_byouki⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{演技|えんぎ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to pretend to be sick)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {演技|えんぎ}: acting (the skill of portraying a character)\n- ⟦{演奏|えんそう}→演奏：01896_ensou⟧: musical performance (playing an instrument)\n- ⟦{公演|こうえん}→公演：11639_kouen⟧: public performance/show (the event itself)\n- ⟦{芝居|しばい}→芝居：03195_shibai⟧: theater, drama; also means \"act\" or \"pretense\"",
